cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: >-
  Selective Gated Residual Neural Fusion with Group Split-Conformal
  Uncertainty Quantification for Milling Surface Roughness
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and analysis code for selectively gated residual
  neural fusion of process variables and vibration signals for milling surface
  roughness prediction, with group split-conformal interval calibration at the
  machining-group level and a post-audit corrective reanalysis.
type: software
